msgid "Slug Sync"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "Rewrites post, page, product and custom post type slugs to match their titles. Previews every change first, keeps the old URLs redirecting, exports a redirect map, and can roll the whole run back."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Armin Kapetanovic"
msgstr ""

